Stephen Fewer — ReflectiveDLLInjection
--------------------------------------

Description
  Reflective DLL injection proof of concept and the source of well-known
  LoadLibraryA and GetProcAddress hash constants used by reflective loaders.

Author
  Stephen Fewer

Source
  https://github.com/stephenfewer/ReflectiveDLLInjection

License
  BSD 3-Clause. The complete notice is reproduced in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.

Used in
  dumpex/rules_pkg/data/yara/suspicious_memory.yar
  (Reflective_Loader_Signature)

Nature of use
  The hash constants 0x4EC20EEC (LoadLibraryA) and 0x7CB89778
  (GetProcAddress) are derived from the ReflectiveDLLInjection
  implementation.
